{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 2260189778999585853,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Migrating from WASI 0.2 to WASI 0.3",
      "source_hash": 15112554926485894685,
      "context_hash": 5461819028493587603,
      "translation": "WASI 0.2에서 WASI 0.3으로 마이그레이션하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "WASI 0.3 reshapes WASI's interfaces around the [native async primitives](./async.md) `async func`, `stream<T>`, and `future<T>`.",
      "source_hash": 5906986050525970501,
      "context_hash": 2899956858234347020,
      "translation": "WASI 0.3은 [네이티브 비동기 기본 요소](./async.md)인 `async func`, `stream<T>`, `future<T>`를 중심으로 WASI의 인터페이스를 재구성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Most of the changes in `wasi:cli`, `wasi:http`, `wasi:filesystem`, and `wasi:sockets` are consequences of moving to these primitives.",
      "source_hash": 1004755171712776817,
      "context_hash": 7780261680605726238,
      "translation": "`wasi:cli`, `wasi:http`, `wasi:filesystem`, `wasi:sockets`의 변경 사항 대부분은 이러한 기본 요소로 전환한 데 따른 결과입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This page covers the mapping between concepts in WASI 0.2 and WASI 0.3.",
      "source_hash": 17644427060795126482,
      "context_hash": 12916963841266126376,
      "translation": "이 페이지에서는 WASI 0.2와 WASI 0.3 사이의 개념 매핑을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For a WIT-level comparison of every WASI 0.3 interface, see [WASI 0.3](https://wasi.dev/releases/wasi-p3) on WASI.dev.",
      "source_hash": 15397551459189199942,
      "context_hash": 11951991760414285325,
      "translation": "모든 WASI 0.3 인터페이스에 대한 WIT 수준 비교는 WASI.dev의 [WASI 0.3](https://wasi.dev/releases/wasi-p3)을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Do you need to migrate?",
      "source_hash": 5251044846300014058,
      "context_hash": 15765162340654703790,
      "translation": "마이그레이션이 필요합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Not immediately -- WASI 0.2 can be used in hosts just as before, WASI 0.3 is a purely additive change.",
      "source_hash": 1809083161404732484,
      "context_hash": 11708265746246146851,
      "translation": "당장은 아닙니다 -- WASI 0.2는 이전과 마찬가지로 호스트에서 사용할 수 있으며, WASI 0.3은 순전히 추가적인 변경 사항입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Separately, WASI 0.3 runtimes can polyfill 0.2 by mapping 0.2 imports onto native 0.3 primitives at the host boundary, and Wasmtime's `wasmtime serve` already runs both 0.3 and 0.2 components from the same binary, dispatching per component.",
      "source_hash": 15200102305291154994,
      "context_hash": 4588138926318391173,
      "translation": "별도로, WASI 0.3 런타임은 호스트 경계에서 0.2 임포트를 네이티브 0.3 기본 요소로 매핑함으로써 0.2를 폴리필할 수 있으며, Wasmtime의 `wasmtime serve`는 이미 동일한 바이너리에서 0.3과 0.2 컴포넌트를 모두 실행하여 컴포넌트별로 디스패치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Migration is the right call when you want:",
      "source_hash": 11064708074414797707,
      "context_hash": 18168488872339474123,
      "translation": "다음을 원하는 경우 마이그레이션이 올바른 선택입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Composable async across component boundaries (the [sandwich problem](./async.md#the-async-problem-that-wasi-03-solves) goes away).",
      "source_hash": 10028484501197016559,
      "context_hash": 5634306871040697505,
      "translation": "컴포넌트 경계를 넘나드는 합성 가능한 비동기 처리([샌드위치 문제](./async.md#the-async-problem-that-wasi-03-solves)가 사라집니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The newer interface shapes — in particular, `wasi:http`'s collapse of nine resources down to two.",
      "source_hash": 9879380029129752432,
      "context_hash": 4290451925173479137,
      "translation": "더 새로운 인터페이스 형태 — 특히, `wasi:http`가 아홉 개의 리소스를 두 개로 축소한 것.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "First-class support in 0.3-targeted toolchains as they continue to land.",
      "source_hash": 17699150224299155673,
      "context_hash": 794270869847786925,
      "translation": "계속해서 등장하고 있는 0.3 대상 툴체인에서의 퍼스트클래스 지원.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Concept mapping",
      "source_hash": 16440850856747432883,
      "context_hash": 10806257746108535988,
      "translation": "개념 매핑",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "WASI 0.3 replaces every `wasi:io` resource with a Canonical ABI primitive.",
      "source_hash": 13234552644401431405,
      "context_hash": 15835895910531146557,
      "translation": "WASI 0.3은 모든 `wasi:io` 리소스를 정규 ABI 기본 요소로 대체합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "canonical ABI": "정규 ABI",
        "resource": "리소스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The translation is mostly one-to-one:",
      "source_hash": 16229649092030275704,
      "context_hash": 13926858918181699361,
      "translation": "이 변환은 대부분 일대일 대응입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "WASI 0.2 (`wasi:io`)",
      "source_hash": 4144453545020613021,
      "context_hash": 10954097237972490088,
      "translation": "WASI 0.2 (`wasi:io`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:02.431242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
